 "note": "Verbs as in tools/parity/runner/README.md. Every step starts with reopen <Txx> (test file fresh, earlier changes discarded) or close_all (no document). Menu commands: orig = menu path, fp = command id (side-specific, so the following actions are listed on both sides). Logical keys used here that may still be unmapped in ui_map.json: dialog.field.<i> / dialog.combo.<i> (i-th edit/combo of the top dialog), labels for dropdowns. Rare verbs used here that the runner may log as unsupported: new_document, window_click, drag_text, hover_text, right_click_text, double_click_text, drag_guide, drag_ruler_origin, drag_dialog_title, drag_dialog_slider, click_dialog_rel, drag_dialog_rel, canvas_wheel, reopen_dialog (repeat the opening actions), save_history_as_command, delete_saved_command, add_live_filter, file_dialog_open_types, restart_app, window_size, set_clipboard_image, drop_files, log_focus_cycle-like record_ui {focus_cycle:n}. Object 'I1#2' = duplicate of I1; 'text' = first text element; canvas_drag option hold = screenshot while the button is held.",
